JPdfBookmarks — acknowledgements

The project owes thanks to everyone who reported bugs, suggested features,
and contributed patches on SourceForge and GitHub.

In particular:

- Contributors on SourceForge Subversion (including work on the pdfbox branch and maintenance of the original Ant-based build).

- life888888 — for publishing a Maven-based continuation of the SourceForge
  code (including fixes for CJK characters in bookmark titles in GUI mode,
  logging and font configuration, documentation, and links to native installer
  build tooling). Upstream fork: https://github.com/life888888/JPdfBookmarks

- Users who tested releases and filed feedback on forums and trackers.

If you should be named here and are missing, please open an issue or send a
patch to AUTHORS/THANKS.
